{"seq":3,"slug":"morphology-syntax","title":"形态学与句法学","stage":"DONE","category":"linguistics","chapterCount":3,"docCount":13,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 形态学与句法学：词的构造与句子的组织\n\n## 定位与边界\n\n形态学与句法学是语言学语法研究的两大核心领域，分别处理\"词的内部结构\"和\"句子的组织规律\"。本 hub 聚焦语法形式层面的分析方法与理论框架。与相邻 hub 形成明确的层次互补：向下承接「语音学与音系学」提供的音段表征（语素的语音实现依赖音系规则），向上对接「语义学与语用学」所关注的意义解读（句法结构是意义组合的骨架）。简言之，音系学告诉我们\"语素听起来像什么\"，形态句法告诉我们\"语素和词如何组合成合法结构\"，语义语用则告诉我们\"这些结构表达了什么含义\"。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 hub 共三章，按\"从小到大\"的语言单位递进组织：\n\n**第一章 词汇结构**——从最小的有意义单位——语素出发，讲解自由语素与黏着语素的分类方式，辨析派生形态（造新词）与屈折形态（表语法范畴）的功能差异，并通过形态类型学将孤立语、黏着语、屈折语、多式综合语进行跨语言对比。\n\n**第二章 句法结构**——进入短语与句子层面，介绍短语结构规则与句法树表示法，讲解乔姆斯基转换生成语法的移位与深层结构概念，对比管辖与约束理论、最简方案、词汇功能语法、构式语法等主要理论流派，讨论语序类型学在跨语言中的分布规律。\n\n**第三章 语法关系**——深入句子内部的功能角色分配：论元结构与题元角色理论、格系统与主谓一致的形态句法表现、约束理论中的照应与代词指称，以及复杂句中从属关系与嵌套结构的生成机制。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习：先掌握词法分析工具，再进入句法树与理论框架，最后在语法关系层面整合两者。每学完一章，尝试用不同语言的实例验证理论预测。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 语言学基本概念（语言的任意性、系统性、层级性）——建议先阅读「语言学导论」第一章\n- 国际音标基础（能识读语素的音位转写）——建议先阅读「语音学与音系学」第一章\n- 基本的集合与树形结构图表阅读能力\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [语音学与音系学](../02_phonetics-phonology/)——理解语素的语音实现与音系交替规则\n- [语义学与语用学](../04_semantics-pragmatics/)——句法结构如何承载与约束语义解读\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"word-structure","title":"词汇结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/word-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"morpheme-types","title":"语素类型与词的构成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/word-structure/morpheme-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"derivation-inflection","title":"派生与屈折","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/word-structure/derivation-inflection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"morphological-typology","title":"形态类型学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/word-structure/morphological-typology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sentence-structure","title":"句法结构","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"phrase-structure","title":"短语结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/phrase-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"movement-transformations","title":"移位与转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/movement-transformations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"syntactic-theories","title":"当代句法理论对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/syntactic-theories"},{"seq":4,"slug":"transformational-grammar","title":"转换生成语法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/transformational-grammar"},{"seq":5,"slug":"word-order-typology","title":"语序类型学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/sentence-structure/word-order-typology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"grammatical-relations","title":"语法关系","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"argument-structure","title":"论元结构与题元角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/argument-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"case-agreement","title":"格与一致关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/case-agreement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"agreement-binding","title":"一致性与约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/agreement-binding"},{"seq":4,"slug":"voice-case-systems","title":"语态与格系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/voice-case-systems"},{"seq":5,"slug":"complex-sentences","title":"复杂句式与从属关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/complex-sentences"}]}]}